msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: あの、そこの君。少しお話いいですか？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_00"
msgid "Um, excuse me. You there. May I ask you a question?"
msgstr "Перепрошую, ти там. Можна дещо запитати?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: あ～ら乳臭いガキンチョのくせに、
#. JA:   姫様をナンパするなんてなんて命しらずぐっ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_01"
msgid ""
"Oh, my. You look like you just got potty trained, and \n"
"you're already trying to hit on the princess?\n"
"You're really asking for it!"
msgstr ""
"Овва, молоко на губах іще не обсохло, а вже до принцеси\n"
"залицяєшся? Оце ти безстрашний... Ґх!"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: で、私に何の用かしら？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_02"
msgid "Is there something you wish to ask of me?"
msgstr "То що тобі від мене потрібно?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: あの、君の横を通り過ぎた瞬間、
#. JA:   姉さんの様子がおかしくなって……君、姉さんに何かした？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_03"
msgid ""
"Um, right after we passed you, my sister started to act\n"
"weird... Did you do something to her?"
msgstr ""
"Щойно ми пройшли повз тебе, сестра почала поводитися\n"
"дивно... Ти щось із нею зробила?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: さあ。お姉さん、コウモリが苦手なのではなくて？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_04"
msgid "No? Perhaps your sister is afraid of bats?"
msgstr "Хтозна. Може, твоя сестра боїться кажанів?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ひいぃぃっ！！！姫様、なんでオイラに振るッスか！？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_05"
msgid "Aaaah! Princess, why do you put the blame on me!?"
msgstr "А-а-а!!! Принцесо, чому ви переводите стрілки на мене?!"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 巨大なコウモリに黒猫。魔女かと思ったけど違う。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_06"
msgid ""
"A huge bat and a black cat...\n"
"I thought you were a witch, but I guess I was wrong."
msgstr ""
"Величезний кажан і чорний кіт... Я подумав, що ти відьма,\n"
"але, схоже, помилився."

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 姉さんが僕以外の人に反応することは今までなかったんだ。
#. JA:   やっぱりおかしいよ。君は誰なの？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_07"
msgid ""
"My sister has never reacted to anyone but me.\n"
"Something is definitely wrong. Who are you?"
msgstr ""
"Досі сестра не реагувала ні на кого, крім мене. Щось тут\n"
"таки не так. Хто ти така?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: レディに対して詮索するのは紳士的とはいいがたいわ。
#. JA:   礼儀知らずな坊や、マナーというものを教えてあげる。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_08"
msgid ""
"A gentleman should not pry into a lady's affairs.\n"
"Perhaps I should take this opportunity to teach you\n"
"some manners."
msgstr ""
"Розпитувати про особисті справи пані — не надто\n"
"шляхетно. Нечемний хлопчику, я навчу тебе гарних манер."

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 姉さん、この人危険すぎる――。
#. JA:   申し訳ありませんが、ここは一旦引かせていただきます……！
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_09"
msgid ""
"This person is too dangerous, Sis.\n"
"I'm sorry, but we're going to have to retreat for now...!"
msgstr ""
"Сестро, вона надто небезпечна... Перепрошую, але цього\n"
"разу нам доведеться відступити...!"

#. Key: ArcEveRC01_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 自分自身も演じきれないなんて、役者としては三流以下ね。
#. JA:   そうね、五順後くらいに出直してきなさい。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC01_10"
msgid ""
"He cannot even play himself.\n"
"Even soap opera stars are better than that.\n"
"Perhaps with some training...a few years of training..."
msgstr ""
"Навіть себе самого не здатен зіграти до кінця — як актор\n"
"ти нижчий за третьосортного. Повертайся десь через пʼять\n"
"циклів."

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: あら、えいゆうさん、お久しぶり。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_00"
msgid "Oh my! It has been too long, Mr. Hero."
msgstr "О, пане герою, давно не бачилися."

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 何だ、貴様は。
#. JA:   ここは子供が来るような場所ではない、早々に去るがいい。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_01"
msgid ""
"Who the hell are you?\n"
"This isn't a place for children. Just run along."
msgstr ""
"Ти ще хто така? Дітям тут не місце. Забирайся звідси, і\n"
"негайно."

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ふぅん、こういう答え方をするの。
#. JA:   面白いわ、色々と狂い始めているのね。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_02"
msgid ""
"Oh, I see. So this is how you talk to me now?\n"
"Interesting. I see things have begun to change."
msgstr ""
"Овва, ось як ти мені відповідаєш. Цікаво... Все довкола\n"
"починає йти шкереберть."

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 聞いてるのか？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_03"
msgid "Are you listening to me?"
msgstr "Ти мене слухаєш?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: この事象は私の干渉によるものではないようね。
#. JA:   私以外に干渉している者がいると見て間違いなさそう。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_04"
msgid ""
"This is not my doing. There can be no other conclusion...\n"
"Someone else is interfering."
msgstr ""
"Схоже, це явище спричинило не моє втручання. Поза\n"
"сумнівом, тут втручається хтось іще."

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ギィ、ノドが渇いたわ。お茶をいれなさい。
#. JA:   お茶請けはスコーンがいいわ、クロテッドクリームを添えてね。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_05"
msgid ""
"Gii, I feel parched. I require tea. And a scone as well.\n"
"Do not forget to put the Devonshire cream on the side."
msgstr ""
"Ґі, мене мучить спрага. Завари чаю. А до нього подай скон\n"
"із топленими вершками."

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: あいッス！！
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_06"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr "Слухаюсь!!"

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 使い魔！？貴様、何者だ？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_07"
msgid "Who the hell are you?"
msgstr "Фамільяр?! Хто ти така?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: うるさい狗だこと。躾がなってないわね。
#. JA:   いいわ。お茶の準備が出来るまで構ってあげるから、いらっしゃい。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_08"
msgid ""
"Ugh. You are little more than an angry dog.\n"
"It would appear your training was inadequate.\n"
"Come. I will play with you until my tea is prepared."
msgstr ""
"Який галасливий пес. Зовсім невихований. Гаразд, я\n"
"розважу тебе, доки готують чай. Підходь."

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: くそっ、ただものではないな、貴様……ぐはっ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_09"
msgid "Damn it! You're not just an ordinary girl... *cough*"
msgstr "Клята... Ти не проста дівчина... Ґах."

#. Key: ArcEveRC02_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 飼われた英雄の割には、なかなか上出来だったわ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC02_10"
msgid "Not bad for a lap dog."
msgstr "Як для прирученого песика-героя, зовсім непогано."

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ここは静かでいいわ。
#. JA:   でもお茶を楽しむには少し寂しすぎる場所ね。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_00"
msgid ""
"It is rather quiet here.\n"
"Perhaps a little too quiet to enjoy a cup of tea..."
msgstr ""
"Тут тихо, і це добре. Але для чаювання місце трохи надто\n"
"самотнє."

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 誰かと思えば意外な客だな。
#. JA:   如何した、時間には未だ早いぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_01"
msgid ""
"Well, this is quite a surprise.\n"
"What brings you here? Seems a bit early."
msgstr ""
"Неочікуваний гість. Що сталося? Твій час іще не настав."

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: あら、私の時計では時間ぴったりだけど？
#. JA:   そちらの時計が遅れているんじゃなくて。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_02"
msgid ""
"Oh? My watch begs to differ.\n"
"Perhaps yours is simply slow?"
msgstr ""
"Справді? За моїм годинником час настав точнісінько.\n"
"Може, це твій відстає?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: よもや貴様が干渉して来るとはな。
#. JA:   ――私の前に立つ意味、無論解って居るな？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_03"
msgid ""
"I never thought you would intrude.\n"
"You do know what your presence before me means,\n"
"correct?"
msgstr ""
"Не думав, що ти втрутишся. Ти ж розумієш, що означає\n"
"стати переді мною?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ええ、それを笑いに来てあげたのよ。アルルカン？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_04"
msgid "Of course. I am here to laugh in your face, harlequin."
msgstr "Авжеж. Я саме й прийшла з тебе посміятися, арлекіне."

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: くくく、貴様に道化呼ばわりされるとは思わなかったな。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_05"
msgid ""
"Hmhmhm, I never thought I'd see the day where you\n"
"would try to make a fool of me."
msgstr "Хм-хм-хм... Не думав, що саме ти назвеш мене блазнем."

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: では反逆の為に、貴様で時の歯車を進める。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_06"
msgid "In return, I shall sever the threads of your fate."
msgstr "Тоді я використаю тебе, щоб зрушити шестерні часу."

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！！
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_07"
msgid ""
"I am the white void I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_08"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: クッ、事象干渉か！邪魔をするな化け猫め！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_09"
msgid "Gah, how dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх, втручання у причинність! Не заважай, клята\n"
"відьомська кицько!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveRC03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: なるほど、あの子のしわざだったのね。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC03_10"
msgid "How interesting... Then she was behind all of this."
msgstr "Он воно що. То це була її робота."

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_00"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ひひひ姫様、オイラ怖いッス！
#. JA:   なんだかヤバイ香りがぷんぷんするッス～～！！
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_01"
msgid ""
"P-P-P-Princess, I...I'm scared!\n"
"I have a really bad feeling about this!"
msgstr ""
"П-п-принцесо, мені страшно! Від неї аж тхне небезпекою!!"

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_02"
msgid "Scanning: complete. Auto-mode: confirmed."
msgstr "Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано."

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 姫様、アイツ攻撃する気満々だよ！！大丈夫なのかい？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_03"
msgid ""
"Princess, she's going to attack us!\n"
"Are we going to be OK?"
msgstr "Принцесо, вона явно збирається напасти! Ми впораємося?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ギィ、ナゴ、よく聞きなさい。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_04"
msgid "Gii, Nago, listen carefully."
msgstr "Ґі, Наґо, слухайте уважно."

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ここはたくさんの物語が交差する場所。
#. JA:   この場所で悲劇が始まり、そして終焉を迎える。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_05"
msgid ""
"This is the moment where alternate histories intersect.\n"
"This is where the tragedy began...and this is where it shall\n"
"meet its end."
msgstr ""
"Тут перетинається безліч історій. У цьому місці трагедія\n"
"починається — і тут само завершується."

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: でもそれももうすぐ終わり。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_06"
msgid "But soon...all of that will be over."
msgstr "Але й цьому скоро настане край."

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……
#. JA:   対象を「外周因子」と認識　因子の排除を開始します
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_07"
msgid ""
"Scanning: complete. IFF determined. Processing...\n"
"Subject in class: peripheral elements...\n"
"Begin termination of peripheral element."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"схвалено... Ціль визначено як «периферійний чинник».\n"
"Розпочинаю усунення чинника."

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: さあ、かわいそうなお人形さん。用意はいいかしら？
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_08"
msgid "Come, you poor doll. Are you ready?"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, бідолашна лялечко. Ти готова?"

#. Key: ArcEveRC04_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: あの子のおかげで今回は少しだけ楽しめたわ。
#. JA:   ”また”、会いましょう。今度は少し違った形で……ね。
msgctxt "ArcEveRC04_09"
msgid ""
"I am glad she was able to provide me with an evening's\n"
"entertainment. We should play again, but perhaps in a\n"
"different form..."
msgstr ""
"Завдяки їй цього разу я хоч трохи розважилася.\n"
"Зустріньмося «знову». Наступного разу — в дещо іншій\n"
"подобі..."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ゆっくりとまぶたをあける
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_00"
msgid "I slowly open my eyes."
msgstr "Я повільно розплющую очі."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: また　ここにきてしまった
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_01"
msgid "Here I am, yet again."
msgstr "Я знову опинилася тут."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: ふと　後ろを振り向くと
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_02"
msgid "I turn my head to look back,"
msgstr "Я раптом озираюся назад."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: そこには一人の少女が立っていた
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_03"
msgid "and a lone girl is standing there."
msgstr "Там стоїть самотня дівчина."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 翡翠の瞳を持つ少女が私を見つめている
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_04"
msgid "With eyes like jade, she stares at me."
msgstr "Дівчина з нефритовими очима дивиться на мене."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: その瞳は私の原罪を思い出させる
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_05"
msgid "Her eyes remind me of my sins..."
msgstr "Її очі нагадують мені про мій первородний гріх."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 遠い遠い過去
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_06"
msgid "...of a far, distant past."
msgstr "Про далеке-далеке минуле."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 生涯唯一その血を吸った少年のことを
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_07"
msgid "The boy whose blood I drank...the only one..."
msgstr "Про хлопця — єдиного за все моє життя, чию кров я пила."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 私の至高の牙をただの人間に捧げたあの日のことを
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_08"
msgid "The day I sunk my fangs into an innocent, helpless human."
msgstr ""
"Про той день, коли я встромила свої величні ікла у\n"
"звичайну людину."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 吸血鬼であるが故に吸血鬼でいられなくなったあの時のことを
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_09"
msgid "The day I had no choice but to act as the vampire I am."
msgstr ""
"Про мить, коли саме через те, що я була вампіркою, я\n"
"більше не могла нею лишатися."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 最初でそして最後の
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_10"
msgid "My first and last..."
msgstr "Мій перший і водночас останній..."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 甘い甘い罪
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_11"
msgid "...sweet, sweet sin..."
msgstr "солодкий-солодкий гріх."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: そして私はまた繰り返す
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_12"
msgid "And so, once again..."
msgstr "І я знову повторюю..."

#. Key: ArcEveRC05_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRC_ArcEveRC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRC.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Rachel)
#. Context: Arcade event: Rachel
#. JA: 気が遠くなるほどの果てしない物語を
msgctxt "ArcEveRC05_13"
msgid "...my aimless, endless story begins anew."
msgstr "цю запаморочливо нескінченну історію."
